# RepoReaper reads a GitHub token from the environment. Copy this file to .env
# for local use. .env is git-ignored and the token is never written to disk by
# the app itself.
#
# Token lookup order in the CLI/TUI: GITHUB_TOKEN -> GH_TOKEN -> hidden prompt.
# `reporeaper ui` reads .env and binds to 127.0.0.1 only.
#
# Required permissions are documented in the README (verified empirically).
GITHUB_TOKEN=
